# Convex writes its own deployment values into packages/backend/.env.local
# when you run `pnpm --filter @book-club/backend setup` (aka `npx convex dev`).
# You do NOT hand-edit those.
#
# Separately, auth.config.ts runs on the Convex deployment and reads WORKOS_CLIENT_ID
# from the DEPLOYMENT's environment — not this file. Set it with:
#   npx convex env set WORKOS_CLIENT_ID client_xxxxxxxx
#
# See ../../SETUP.md for the full walkthrough.
